				options: { none: 'None', helper: 'A tool, e.g. polishing scripts or single backgrounds', pipeline: 'An AI voice reads AI text over AI images or clips', automated: 'Almost fully automated' },
				text: 'AI isn’t banned. What can’t be monetized is AI content made from generic templates that looks mass-produced and has no perspective of your own.',
